      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;JRuby is Ruby on the JVM, and the first mainstream JVM&#xA;language to make use of invokedynamic. We also have worked around&#xA;limitations in OpenJDK&amp;#39;s APIs (process mgmt, IO, native POSIX support)&#xA;in many clever ways. Lots to talk about here.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
